        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 918, Posh Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeither boring nor gaudy, Omnia's 918 Lever exudes the perfect level of poshness that other levers can't achieve. Everything from the 2-5/8\" diameter rose to the gradually widening of the handle tells a story of opulence and class. Made out of solid brass, this sophisticated lever and rose set is made with the exceptional high quality that make Omnia Industries on of the top door hardware manufacturers. The Posh Solid Brass Lever is designed to be easy to install, especially on pre-drilled doors with 2-1/8\" holes. It is available in 7 beautiful finishes in dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Posh Door Lever with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 918 Posh Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-brass-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Posh Solid Brass Lever",
                "description": "Omnia 918/00 Posh Leverset - Neither boring nor gaudy, Omnia's 918 Lever exudes the perfect level of poshness that other levers can't achieve. Everything from the 2-5/8 inch diameter rose to the gradually widening of the handle tells a story of opulence and class. Made out of solid brass, this sophisticated lever and rose set is made with the exceptional high quality that make Omnia Industries on of the top door hardware manufacturers. It is designed to be easy to install, especially on pre-drilled doors with 2-1/8 inch holes. It is available in 7 beautiful finishes in dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
